ComfyUI-HyperFlow-Director is a derivative work of ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-Director
(https://github.com/seesee75-commits/ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-Director, GPL-3.0).

Changes: the planner, context-card and render code was copied into this pack; every node ID, custom type, HTTP route,
storage folder, CSS class and browser event was renamed (NG* -> HFD*, /ng/ -> /hfd/, ...) so it can be installed beside
the original; the render graph was rewritten for HyperFlow H3 Flash (euler, CFG 1, 4/6/8-step schedule, no Turbo LoRA,
no MiniMaxH3SigmaShift); the Studio, Storyboard, Guide, Connector, Output, Preview, Control, Still and Legacy Director
nodes were not carried over.

The Flash step schedule constants come from the HyperFlow H3 Flash model card and ComfyUI-HyperFlow-Flash (GPL-3.0).
